hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"247","[AI-translation] Safa ke qareeb aakar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne padha: Beshak Safa-Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Allah ne jis se shuru kiya us se shuru karta hun—Safa se shuru karke us par chadhe Kaaba dekhkar qiblaru hokar Allah ki wahdaniyat bayan ki, takbeer kahi aur kaha: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela; wada poora kiya, bande ki madad ki, girohon ko tanha shikast di; is ke darmiyan dua ki. Yeh teen bar kaha. Marwa par bhi Safa jaisa kiya. [Safa-Marwa mein padhe]"
